WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.880
Amazon sellers leverage various technologies to launch, manage, and grow their businesses.

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:17.040
While some sellers rely exclusively on Seller Central's built-in tools for listing, pricing,

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:23.280
and inventory management, others enhance their operations through third-party applications.

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:29.840
These specialized apps provide advanced functionality to streamline and scale business operations,

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:36.560
similar to how smartphone apps complete specific tasks like restaurant reviews or weather checks.

00:00:36.560 --> 00:00:42.960
Amazon maintains a comprehensive catalog of approved applications in the Selling Partner App Store,

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.780
accessible at sellercentral.

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:46.720
amazon.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:50.480
com/selling-partner-appstore.

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:57.680
This centralized marketplace houses vetted applications that integrate with your selling operations.

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:03.840
To navigate the App Store, select an app category from the home page or use the search functionality

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:07.000
to locate specific applications by name.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.160
Each app's detail page provides comprehensive

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:16.800
information about features, functionality, and developer contact details for quick access and

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:17.367
implementation.

00:01:17.367 --> 00:01:23.600
Every application in the Selling Partner App Store undergoes Amazon's review

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:25.376
and authorization process.

00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:29.520
The developers publishing these applications are similarly

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:33.311
vetted by Amazon, ensuring quality and reliability.

00:01:33.311 --> 00:01:36.560
Applications access your selling data through

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:45.280
secure API services, the current Selling Partner API, SP API, or the Legacy Marketplace Web Services,

00:01:45.280 --> 00:01:46.507
Amazon MWS.

00:01:46.507 --> 00:01:52.640
Third-party pricing applications offer distinct advantages over standard Seller

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:53.733
Central tools.

00:01:53.733 --> 00:01:59.200
These applications can automate pricing with reduced manual effort, helping

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:02.708
maintain competitive positioning in the marketplace.

00:02:02.708 --> 00:02:06.800
Advanced pricing criteria options such as fulfillment

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:12.495
method-based pricing provide greater flexibility in pricing strategies.

00:02:12.495 --> 00:02:13.760
Specialized scheduling

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:19.760
features allow synchronization with major shopping events like Prime Day, optimizing revenue during

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:21.440
high traffic periods.

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:26.480
These enhanced capabilities enable more sophisticated pricing approaches than

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:27.975
basic automation tools.

00:02:27.975 --> 00:02:32.960
To demonstrate the range of available pricing solutions, consider three

00:02:32.960 --> 00:02:36.960
applications from the Selling Partner App Store, informed.

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:40.460
co, re-price it, and Seller Engine.

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:40.960
These

00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:46.160
examples illustrate different approaches to pricing automation without constituting Amazon

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:46.856
recommendations.

00:02:46.856 --> 00:02:47.552
Informed.

00:02:47.552 --> 00:02:53.120
co provides both predefined and customizable pricing rules

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:55.013
for comprehensive pricing control.

00:02:55.013 --> 00:02:58.800
Create rules that price products based on either

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:05.360
FBA or MFN Seller offers or optimize pricing when no featured offer exists for a product.

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:11.280
The application handles scenarios where you're the sole seller for a particular ASIN.

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:17.527
The platform includes pricing data visualization and filtering capabilities.

00:03:17.527 --> 00:03:18.720
View profits,

00:03:18.720 --> 00:03:25.120
margins, and costs associated with each product to identify high performing and underperforming

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:26.000
listings quickly.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:31.280
Re-price it offers flexible pricing rules and options tailored to different

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:32.240
product conditions.

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:38.000
Create specific rules for new or used items or exclude individual products

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.973
from broader inventory rules.

00:03:39.973 --> 00:03:43.920
The application supports pricing schedules aligned with Amazon

00:03:43.920 --> 00:03:48.006
Shopping events for strategic pricing during peak periods.

00:03:48.006 --> 00:03:50.560
Detailed reporting features help track

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:56.560
pricing history fluctuations, providing insights into pricing performance and market dynamics.

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:03.920
Seller Engine focuses on real-time pricing optimization rather than standard 10-15-minute

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:05.187
update intervals.

00:04:05.187 --> 00:04:11.520
The application calculates minimum prices using associated costs and fees

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:16.751
with options to add minimum markup percentages to ensure profitability.

00:04:16.751 --> 00:04:18.320
Cross-checking capabilities

00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:20.048
help price ASINs effectively.

00:04:20.048 --> 00:04:24.800
When you're the only seller for a product, Seller Engine identifies

00:04:24.800 --> 00:04:28.669
similar listings to inform pricing strategy development.

00:04:28.669 --> 00:04:30.880
These three applications represent

00:04:30.880 --> 00:04:36.288
a small sample of available pricing solutions in the Selling Partner App Store.

00:04:36.288 --> 00:04:37.120
To discover

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:43.040
additional pricing applications, navigate to the automated pricing category on the App Store home

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:43.618
page.

00:04:43.618 --> 00:04:50.560
Use available filters to search by specific programs, star ratings, supported languages,

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:52.312
or marketplace compatibility.

00:04:52.312 --> 00:04:56.400
Third-party pricing applications provide powerful tools

00:04:56.400 --> 00:05:01.760
to enhance your Amazon Selling Operations beyond basic Seller Central functionality.

